              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 17:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumazuba ayo ndakabona mucisi ca-Juda bamwi ibakali kulyataula mumalindi aakusinina masaansa buzuba bwa-Sabata, abamwi bakali kutebula maila akuyumuzya imbongolo ngao, awaini, amasaansa, ankuyu, azintu zimwi zyamisyobo misyobo, nkabela bakali kuzileta ku-Jerusalemu buzuba bwa-Sabata. Elyo ndakakazyanya abo mubuzuba nibakauzya zilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kwakakala nkuko bamwi bantu ba-Turo ibakali kuleta inswi azintu zyoonse zyakusambala, bakali kuuzya kubana ba-Juda mu-Jerusalemu buzuba bwa-Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ndakakazyanya abapati ba-Juda, ndabaambila kuti, Ino ncinzi cintu eci cibi ncimucita kukubisizya buzuba bwa-Sabata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa bamauso banu teebakacita obo? Nciceeco Leza wesu ncaakaletela aya mapenzi oonse kulindiswe akumunzi wesu, Mulaletela cisi ca-Israyeli bukali mbumubisizya Sabata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 23:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.14+EXO.31.15+EXO.31.16+EXO.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 31:14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.7.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela nikwakatalika kusia kumilyango ya-Jerusalemu kumatalikilo aa-Sabata, ndakalailila kuti bajale zitendele, batajaluli limbi mane buzuba bwa-Sabata bumane. Nkabela ndakabika bamwi balanda bangu kumilyango, kuti kutaletwi mukuli nuuba umwi mubuzuba bwa-Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo basambazi abasikuuzya zintu komwe na kobile bakakala-kala anze lya-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele ndakabatapatila, ndati, Ino nkaambonzi mulakala-kala kubulambo. Na mwacita obo limbi, nzoomujata. Lino kuzwa kuciindi eco teebakabeola limbi buzuba bwa-Sabata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 12:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela ndakalailila ba-Levi kuti balisalazye, baze kuzoolindila milyango kukusalazya buzuba bwa-Sabata. Kondiyeeya, O Leza wangu, nkaambo kamakani aya. Kondifwida luse muluzyalo lwako lupati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
